umbnails mod.\r\n\r\nThe top five comments will scroll through next to the level name, showing the commentor's icon and the amount of likes\r\nthe comment got next to their comment.\r\n\r\nThis mod will **not** work on a GDPS, and will show comments from the vanilla game for that level ID, instead.\r\n\r\nThank you to [dankmeme01](https://github.com/dankmeme01/) for providing a server to host the mod on!\r\n","changelog":"# Comments Preview\r\n## v1.0.8\r\n- Fixed the fading not working correctly by fixing a premultiplied alpha issue\r\n\r\n## v1.0.7\r\n- Fixed nothing actually showing up ever\r\n\r\n## v1.0.6\r\n- Fixed a linkage error\r\n\r\n## v1.0.5\r\n- Improved fading out by making everything fade together\r\n- Added the commenter's name above their icon\r\n\r\n## v1.0.4\r\n- Improved communication with the server and batched requests better\r\n\r\n## v1.0.3\r\n- Fixed a QOLMod crash\r\n- Improved performance by using Geode's Label class over Cocos's CCLabelBMFont\r\n\r\n## v1.0.2\r\n- Improved the black outline when fading out by making it less \"thick\"\r\n\r\n## v1.0.1\r\n- Improved queueing by adding a delay\r\n- Improved the mod description\r\n\r\n## v1.0.0\r\n- Initial release\r\n","created_at":"2026-08-05T16:27:19Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T17:16:19Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/undefined06855/Comments-Preview"}}